      "Nerol=citrus-rose floral seam keeping immortelle connected to lavender inside the fixed 300 uL socket"
    ]
  },
  "target_identity": {
    "north_star": "La Nuit's cool cardamom-lavender-cedar vertical lit by an immortelle afterglow: honeyed hay, dry herbal warmth, and a restrained maple-curry shadow that reads sensual and nocturnal, never syrupy gourmand, savory curry, tobacco, or balsamic amber.",
    "functional_architecture": [
      "cardamom remains the cool opening recognizer",
      "immortelle absolute supplies honeyed-dry body while Helichrysum EO supplies volatile herbal lift",
      "hay and maple facets are subordinate character echoes rather than a gourmand accord",
      "Nerol and lavender preserve floral-terpenic continuity into literal cedar and vetiver"
    ],
    "protected_identity": [
      "Cardamom Oil",
      "Lavender",
      "Cedarwood Virginia",
      "Vetiver Haiti",
      "Coumarin"
    ],
    "primary_axis": "honeyed-dry immortelle afterglow nested inside the protected cardamom-lavender-cedar vertical",
    "variant_socket": {
      "active_ppm_w_w": 66666.667,
      "current_raw_ul": 300,
      "target_allocation": {
        "Immortelle Absolute": 18000,
        "Helichrysum EO": 12000,
        "Hay Absolute": 8000,
        "Maple Lactone": 4000,
        "Nerol": 6000,
        "Cardamom increment": 8000,
        "Lavender increment": 6000,
        "Hedione increment": 4666.6666
      },
      "current_allocation_ul": {
        "Immortelle Absolute (10% in DPG)": 80,
        "Helichrysum EO": 40,
        "Hay Absolute (10%)": 50,
        "Maple Lactone (20%)": 20,
        "Nerol": 40,
        "Cardamom EO": 30,
        "Lavender EO (BONTAUX SAS)": 20,
        "Hedione": 20
      }
    },
    "selection_rationale": [
      "Immortelle Absolute is the honeyed-dry body and Helichrysum EO is its more volatile lift; using both is target-linked, but only the absolute has current composite decomposition coverage.",
      "Hay Absolute extends coumarinic dryness and Maple Lactone supplies only a trace italidione-like maple echo; larger sweet materials, vanillin, balsams, tobacco, and the lost tinctures were rejected as genre-changing shortcuts.",
      "Nerol was selected over Neroli because orange blossom is not central; Nerol gives a precise floral-terpenic seam without introducing a neroli identity.",
      "The immortelle, cardamom, lavender, bergamot, and Nerol materials share terpene/oxygenated-terpene continuity; no unrelated natural-flower kitchen sink is added.",
      "EB remains the sole structural musk; additional musks would blur the dry honeyed character."
    ],
    "drift_risk": "Maple, hay, curry, coumarin, tobacco, balsams, or musk excess would turn Immortelle Nuit into a gourmand-oriental or savory novelty and erase La Nuit."
  },
